LumièreHDR to-do list. Bugs and feature requests:
https://github.com/thommy87/LumiereHDR/issues

Open items
----------

- Windows taskbar progress bar under Qt 6. Qt 6 removed QtWinExtras, so
  the taskbar progress and jump list (src/OsIntegration/ecwin7.cpp, built
  only behind LHDR_WIN_TASKBAR with Qt 5) are gone in Qt 6 builds. Restore
  them by calling ITaskbarList3 (and the jump list API) directly.
- Replace the remaining QRegExp uses and the SAX XML parser in the help
  browser, then drop the Qt6::Core5Compat dependency.
- UI clean-up pass (look and feel, after the functional Phase 2 work),
  from Alex's feedback on 2.8.3:
  - integrate the step bar into the window design instead of a plain
    strip above the image area
  - tidy the work area so it is clearer and more intuitive
  - previews in the tone mapping panel default to a very low resolution;
    pick a sensible default
  - image tabs: squeezed in between, and very long file names make tabs
    huge; elide names to a fixed length with "..." so all tabs have the
    same width (full name in the tooltip)

